{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10241070","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10241070","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1024107001:0":{"text":"そちらの気品溢れるお嬢さん。黒いアヒルについて知ってることを教えてくれないかな？","source_cn":"这位优雅端庄的小姐，您能告诉我一些关于黑鸭的可贵情报吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF75268C58D22078","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1024107002:0":{"text":"あら～褒めるのが上手ね！","source_cn":"呀~小哥真是客气！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xADE5BC82F42E9F78","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1024107003:0":{"text":"あのクソ……んんっ、変な黒いアヒルったら、ずっとガチョウのいる柵の周りをうろうろして……","source_cn":"那只该死的——咳嗯，奇怪的黑鸭子，总是在我的鹅圈外踱步。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA11E7E1EFF681BA6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1024107004:0":{"text":"昨日の夜なんか、あいつがガチョウに向かって鳴いたせいで、あたしが苦労して育てたガチョウたちがみんな飛んで行っちゃったの！","source_cn":"昨天晚上，它对着鹅群叫了几声，然后我含辛茹苦养大的白鹅...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4445628EEC226C6F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1024107005:0":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">ミスリル商会の人</style>もそれを見たはずよ！","source_cn":"不只是我，<style=highlight>秘银商会的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24AE04F47D1ACF3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1024107006:0":{"text":"大変申し訳ありません。損失はミスリル商会が弁償します。お受け取り下さい！","source_cn":"真是对不起，秘银商会一定会赔偿您的损失，请笑纳！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x931B114BA7A50178","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1024107007:0":{"text":"それで、ガチョウの……おっと、君のお住まいはどちらかな？","source_cn":"那么，您的鹅圈——不，您的府邸，在哪里呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF538E80FFF6D9116","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1024107008:0":{"text":"あたしの家は聖石町の西にあるわ。","source_cn":"我家就在圣石镇西边。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC321D85968D25993","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1024107009:0":{"text":"ねえ、お兄さんはどちらに住んでるの？あたしの住所も教えたんだし、お互い仲良くしましょうよ～","source_cn":"话说小哥，你住哪里？我都把住址告诉你了，咱们以后可以多...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD157ED6B034CF6FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1024107010:0":{"text":"はは、それは光栄だ。でも今はちょっと忙しくてね、また今度話そう！","source_cn":"——感谢小姐垂青，我还有事要忙，之后一定！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF83CF251FED5E9B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","doc